Drop the compiled ruzit_ffi_counter library here after `cargo build --release`
in ../rust-ffi-counter:

  Windows: ruzit_ffi_counter.dll
  Linux:   libruzit_ffi_counter.so
  macOS:   libruzit_ffi_counter.dylib

The runner finds it via FFI.Load("ruzit_ffi_counter") whether you launch
through `ruzit test` (project-root bin/) or run a built game (bin/ next
to the launcher exe).
